  "notes": "Speculative next-generation manifest for sensitivity studies; treat absolute numbers as unvalidated, use relative trends only. Provenance is deliberately mixed and recorded here (drift D3): transfer-channel widths and per-dtype Cube rates follow ascend-pipesim's v3 model (128 B/cycle engines, 8192 MACs/cycle, FP8 path), while domain capacities and the UB partitioning quadruple follow the static analyzer's enforcement model (512 KiB L1; UB strictly split between tensors and the SIMT DataCache). ascend-pipesim additionally models a 1 MiB L1 for this part - 2x the enforcement capacity recorded here - so L1-sensitive conclusions differ between tools until the datasheet settles it.",
